    "preamble": "Mukesh Kumar Saha vs The State Of Jharkhand on 24 April, 2017 Author: Anant Bijay Singh Bench: Anant Bijay Singh In The High Court Of Jharkhand At Ranchi A.B.A. No. 1303 of 2017 Mukesh Kumar Saha ..... Petitioner Versus The State of Jharkhand ..... Opp. Party --------- Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Anant Bijay Singh --------- For the Petitioner : Mr. Anurag Kashyap, Advocate. For the State : A.P.P. --------- 06/Dated: 24/04/2017 Petitioner is apprehending his arrest in connection with Government Case No. 16 of 2015, corresponding to T.R. No. 2401 of 2016, registered under Section 59 (iii) of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submitted that there is no allegation against the petitioner that any injury or grievous injury has been caused to any person as a result of such consumption and so, Section 59 (iii) of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 is made out against the petitioner.",
